flowchart TB
    EXP[Expected items from CSV/XLSX/PDF] --> NORM1[Normalize class names and tags]
    OBS[Detections + OCR text] --> NORM2[Normalize class names and text]
    NORM1 --> MATCH[Match by class, then tag text, then zone]
    NORM2 --> MATCH
    MATCH --> M1[Matched pairs]
    MATCH --> M2[Unmatched expected]
    MATCH --> M3[Unmatched observed]
    M1 --> R[Rule engine]
    M2 --> R
    M3 --> R
    R --> OUT{Evidence sufficient?}
    OUT -->|yes, consistent| PASS[PASS]
    OUT -->|yes, inconsistent| FAIL[FAIL]
    OUT -->|no or unsupported| REVIEW[REVIEW]
